#: ../../entities/xicen.rst:1
msgid "Xicen Science and Innovation Center"
msgstr "西岑科创中心"

#: ../../entities/xicen.rst:4
msgid "西岑科创中心"
msgstr "西岑科创中心"

#: ../../entities/xicen.rst:6
msgid "Technology park | Qingpu | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "科技园区｜青浦区｜研究核对日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/xicen.rst:8
msgid ""
"A Qingpu innovation area centered on Huawei Lianqiu Lake and Xicen "
"development. It offers an ecosystem connection, not automatic access to "
"Huawei laboratories, procurement or investment."
msgstr "以华为练秋湖及西岑园区为核心的青浦科创片区。提供生态对接机会，不自动获得华为实验室、采购或投资资格。"

#: ../../entities/xicen.rst:10
msgid ""
"`Evidence S022 "
"<https://www.shqp.gov.cn/shqp/zwgk/tabl/sbljg/20250603/1283025.html>`_. "
"对市政协十四届三次会议 第0746号提案的答复_市建议提案办理结果_意见提案办理_政务公开_上海市青浦区人民政府."
msgstr "`证据 S022 <https://www.shqp.gov.cn/shqp/zwgk/tabl/sbljg/20250603/1283025.html>`_. 对市政协十四届三次会议 第0746号提案的答复_市建议提案办理结果_意见提案办理_政务公开_上海市青浦区人民政府."

#: ../../entities/xicen.rst:12
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "状态与支持"

#: ../../entities/xicen.rst:15
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构有来源，招募待确认"

#: ../../entities/xicen.rst:17
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "本条未核实统一现金资助、免费权益或股权比例，请索取现行书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/xicen.rst:19
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系与位置"

#: ../../entities/xicen.rst:22
msgid ""
"`Official evidence and authority route "
"<https://www.shqp.gov.cn/shqp/zwgk/tabl/sbljg/20250603/1283025.html>`_"
msgstr "`官方来源与主管部门入口 <https://www.shqp.gov.cn/shqp/zwgk/tabl/sbljg/20250603/1283025.html>`_"

#: ../../entities/xicen.rst:24
msgid ""
"A direct program phone or email is not verified here. Use the official "
"route and request the responsible team; no contact has been invented."
msgstr "本版未核实项目直线电话或邮箱。请通过官方渠道索取负责团队，本图谱不编造联系人。"

#: ../../entities/xicen.rst:26
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图位置使用区级或校区锚点，并非核实后的办公室位置。"

#: ../../entities/xicen.rst:28
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/xicen.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/xicen.rst:33
msgid "Identify the corporate business owner and one measurable use case."
msgstr "确认企业业务负责人及可量化场景。"

#: ../../entities/xicen.rst:35
msgid ""
"Submit the product brief, pilot evidence and relevant technical "
"requirements."
msgstr "提交产品简介、试点证据及相关技术要求。"

#: ../../entities/xicen.rst:37
msgid ""
"Confirm cohort availability or agree a scoped pilot, data rights and IP "
"terms."
msgstr "确认招募情况或约定试点范围、数据权利与知识产权。"

#: ../../entities/xicen.rst:39
msgid ""
"Review procurement, payment, acceptance and the production decision "
"separately."
msgstr "分别审核采购、付款、验收及转生产决策。"

#: ../../entities/xicen.rst:41
msgid ":doc:`Qingpu district route </districts/qingpu>`"
msgstr ":doc:`青浦区对接路径 </districts/qingpu>`"
